{"key":"db208a990765aa4f","source_file":"Potts Fi.json","source_id":12728,"source_url":"concordance-firm-to-make-ppl-firmare","term":"Firm, To make","headwords":["Firm, To make","Firmness","Firmness","Firm","Firmly","Firmament","Support"],"latin":["Firmare","Firmatio","Firmitudo","Firmus","Firme","Firmamentum"],"header_pairs":[{"english":["Firm, To make"],"latin":["Firmare"]},{"english":["Firmness"],"latin":["Firmatio"]},{"english":["Firmness"],"latin":["Firmitudo"]},{"english":["Firm"],"latin":["Firmus"]},{"english":["Firmly"],"latin":["Firme"]},{"english":["Firmament","Support"],"latin":["Firmamentum"]}],"header_sentences":[],"redirect_xref":null,"works":["AC","AE","DLove","DSS","SE","TCR"],"contexts":[{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"6383","subsection":"end"},"text":"They thus fortify their affirmative.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"6663","subsection":"2"},"text":"Not only are truths and goods strengthened...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"6664","subsection":null},"text":"That truths are strengthened. Signified.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"8106","subsection":"4"},"text":"A pillar = a support... Because the Natural is like a support or basis to the Spiritual...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"8614","subsection":null},"text":"His hands were firm () = the strength of power.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"9494","subsection":null},"text":"The corners = firmness. Illustrated. AC 9537.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"9538","subsection":null},"text":"The reason firmness exists in the natural sphere... Hence it is that the Natural is the foundation, consequently the support...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"9777","subsection":null},"text":"All things conjoining and strengthening both Heavens. Signified.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"9818","subsection":"3"},"text":"A steadfast spirit () = the understanding and faith of truth.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"DSS","section":"27","subsection":null},"text":"See Base. DSS 27. DSS 34.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"79","subsection":"3"},"text":"Thence came the firmament of the universe.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"80","subsection":"4"},"text":"The ethereal firmament.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"769","subsection":null},"text":"The notion that the universal firmament will perish.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"4564","subsection":"2"},"text":"They had thought nothing firmly, or steadily.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"5629","subsection":null},"text":"There is a certain firmness in the Natural (of the Dutch). LJPost 5. LJPost 14.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AE","section":"219","subsection":"4"},"text":"To make firm its pillars () = to support the truths upon which the Church is founded.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AE","section":"294","subsection":"4"},"text":"To renew a steadfast spirit in the midst of me () = to reform as to the truth of faith.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AE","section":"600","subsection":"12"},"text":"To strengthen the stakes () = confirmation from the Word.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AE","section":"783","subsection":null},"text":"Firmatio et corroboratio. Signified.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AE","section":"799","subsection":"5"},"text":"Stakes = firmatio.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AE","section":"1002","subsection":"end"},"text":"Chaste marriages are... the supports of Heaven... They are its supports by means of power against the Hells.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"DLove","section":"5","subsection":"3"},"text":"Serves as a... support to the larynx.","comment":null,"footnote":null}],"slug":"firm-to-make","url":"/meta/potts/firm-to-make/"}